@section('content')
    <h1>About Daho</h1>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>{{ $description ?? 'Daho Framework' }}</h2>
        <p>Daho is a fast, minimal HTTP framework for Dart backed by a native H2O server.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Features</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Native Core</strong> — H2O server via FFI for maximum performance</li>
        <li><strong>Multi-core</strong> — One worker Isolate per CPU core</li>
        <li><strong>Express-style API</strong> — Familiar routing and middleware patterns</li>
        <li><strong>Template Engine</strong> — Clurit with Blade-like syntax</li>
        <li><strong>Authentication</strong> — JWT, sessions, OAuth2 with daho_auth</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Architecture</h2>
    <div class="card">
        <p>Daho uses a multi-worker architecture:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>H2O handles TCP/HTTP in C (fast)</li>
            <li>Dart handles business logic</li>
            <li>Workers share socket via SO_REUSEPORT</li>
            <li>Lock-free ring buffer for async responses</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

